ement, reputational, and governance overhang [Actual \u2014 law-firm press releases].\n- Services utilization: FY2026 services guided +3% to ~$518M [Estimate \u2014 Zacks]; any utilization drop hits revenue and the \"SaaS story.\"\n- Rate risk: 10Y at 4.71% and rising (hike risk ~33% per Fed funds pricing [Actual \u2014 Trading Economics]) compresses long-duration multiples.\n- Competition: SAP EWM/Blue Yonder/K\u00f6rber discounting; mid-market disruption by AI-native WMS entrants [Assumption].\n- Guidance-year dependence: FY2026 guidance tells us nothing about FY2028\u201330; that path is [Assumption].\n\nSTEP 7-3. PRE-MORTEM (5-year horizon; 3 failure scenarios + early warning indicators):\n1. \"MANH failed because services became the anchor.\" Warning: services revenue growth <0% for 2 consecutive quarters while cloud stays >20% \u2192 OI margin <24%.\n2. \"MANH failed because the high multiple was a rate-illusion.\" Warning: 10Y >5.2%; MANH forward P/E compresses below 28x; RPO growth falls below 10%.\n3. \"MANH failed because the legal/class action metastasized into customer defections.\" Warning: any 8-K revealing SEC inquiry, settlement >$100M [Assumption threshold], or 2+ Fortune-500 customer public migrations away.\n\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\nSECTION 7.5. CORRELATION-ADJUSTED RISK\n\n- Common bear triggers with the rest of a growth-tilted portfolio: rising 10Y, rising USD, recession, credit spread widening, CPI re-acceleration. MANH is sensitive to 4 of 5 (all but USD-materiality) [Arithmetic from Layer 1-3].\n- Tail correlation: in 2022-style rate-shock regimes, MANH would be expected to behave like a